# Malla Charmi Portfolio Website

## Overview

This is my personal portfolio website built to showcase my skills, projects, certifications, internship experience, and achievements in Data Analytics, AI & ML, Cloud Computing, and Frontend Development.

The portfolio features a modern responsive UI with animations, smooth scrolling effects, project showcases, and professional contact integration.

---

## Live Website

https://your-vercel-link.vercel.app

---

## GitHub Repository

https://github.com/mallacharmi/malla-charmi-portfolio

