## Features

* Fully Responsive Design
* Modern Glassmorphism UI
* Smooth Scrolling Navigation
* Animated Sections
* Mobile-Friendly Layout
* Project Showcase
* Skills Section
* Certifications Section
* Contact Section
* Resume Download Button
* SEO Meta Tags
* Accessibility Support using prefers-reduced-motion

