## Projects Included

### 1. Employee Attendance Tracker

Automated attendance management system using SharePoint, Power Automate, and Excel.

### 2. Smart Notes Management System

SharePoint-based platform for organizing and sharing student notes.

### 3. Amazon Sales Dashboard

Interactive sales analytics dashboard built using Excel and Power BI to visualize sales trends, customer insights, and revenue analytics.

