## Run Locally

Clone the repository:

```bash id="o99s3z"
git clone https://github.com/mallacharmi/malla-charmi-portfolio.git
```

Open the project folder:

```bash id="9klz6r"
cd malla-charmi-portfolio
```

Run the website:

* Open `index.html` directly in your browser

---

## Deployment

This project is deployed using Vercel.

